{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000Stellagate is a puzzle action with <strong>gates</strong> that can connect different locations. Connected areas are seamlessly connected to each other, and you are free to throw blocks in or send lasers through them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000<strong>Stella</strong>, a girl with no memory of her past. She wakes up in a room in a castle, and your role is to take her to <strong>the goal</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Puzzle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000<strong>Gates</strong> can connect different locations. Connected locations are seamlessly connected to each other and can be moved, thrown in, and passed through at will. The gates themselves can also be transported and placed in any location. The gradually more complex and intertwining elements are sure to be mind-boggling.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000In the demo, you can play the first 15 stages. They\u2019re tuned to be a bit tougher than the opening of the full game, so there\u2019s plenty of challenge!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3256680?t=1749429097","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3256680?t=1749429097","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256680/feeeacdfea598abeb606a96f2eb0e6ef4f77f6e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749429097","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256680/feeeacdfea598abeb606a96f2eb0e6ef4f77f6e8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749429097","categories":[{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000Stellagate is a puzzle action with <strong>gates</strong> that can connect different locations. Connected areas are seamlessly connected to each other, and you are free to throw blocks in or send lasers through them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000<strong>Stella</strong>, a girl with no memory of her past. She wakes up in a room in a castle, and your role is to take her to <strong>the goal</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Puzzle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000<strong>Gates</strong> can connect different locations. Connected locations are seamlessly connected to each other and can be moved, thrown in, and passed through at will. The gates themselves can also be transported and placed in any location. The gradually more complex and intertwining elements are sure to be mind-boggling.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000In the demo, you can play the first 15 stages. They\u2019re tuned to be a bit tougher than the opening of the full game, so there\u2019s plenty of challenge!</p>","developers":["traP"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2721030","name":"Stellagate"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256680/04498060ae36811d1c8ec07118b7501ed0aa0355/header.jpg?t=1749429097","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257153716,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153716/movie480.mp4?t=1749428861","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153716/movie_max.mp4?t=1749428861"},"name":"Stellagate PV","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257153716/6111f05